  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 4904.05 Display of Certificate",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 4904.05 Display of Certificate.\n\n(a) All certificate holders shall carry the pocket card when acting in the course of his/her trade and shall display the pocket card upon request of an inspector or customer.\n\n(b) All certificate holders who choose to display or advertise the status of their certification to the public shall include their certificate number on such displays or advertisements.\n\nSource. #8650, eff 6-2-06; ss by #9766-A, eff 8-3-10",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/saf-c4900.html"
